      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Superb three-bedroom, B3 rated apartment, ideally located within the highly sought-after Moyglare Court development\n• Accommodation comprises an entrance and inner hallway with utility room, an open plan kitchen/dining/living area, three spacious double bedrooms (including master ensuite) and a main bathroom\n• A large balcony enjoys a very private outlook overlooking beautifully maintained communal green areas\n• Moyglare Court offers convenient access to Maynooth town centre, Maynooth University, local schools, sports clubs and a wide range of shops including Manor Mills and Carton Retail Park\n• Excellent public transport links are nearby, with frequent train and bus services providing easy access to Dublin city centre\n\nGuide Price\n270,000\n\nType of Transaction\n\nFor Sale by Online Auction on Tuesday 29th September 2026 at 12pm.\n \nRegistration to bid must be completed by Friday 25th September 2026.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway 1.2m x 4m, 1.5m x 1.2m\nHardwood flooring, light fitting, roller blinds, door leading to separate hallway space and a hanging pendant light with shade. \n\nInner Hallway 3.6m x 1.7m\nHardwood flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, thermostat and hot press. \n\nLiving/Dining Area (Including Kitchen) 5.5m x 6.7m\nHardwood flooring, hanging pendant lights with shade, roller blinds and door leading to decked balcony.\n \nKitchen\nHardwood flooring, spotlights, roller blinds, floor to wall kitchen cabinets, integrated oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, stainless steel sink and a tiled splashback surround. \n\nUtility Room 1m x 1.3m\nTiled flooring, fully plumbed with washing machine, gas boiler and shelves. \n\nMaster Bedroom (Including Ensuite) 4.4m x 2.5m\nHardwood flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, roller blinds, fitted wardrobes and fitted mirror. \n\nEnsuite 2.4m x 1.2m \nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback, fitted mirror and shaving light, shower cubicle with tiled surround and extractor fan. \n\nBedroom 2 2.8m x 3.1m\nHardwood flooring, hanging pendant light with shade and fitted wardrobes. \n \nBedroom 3 2.4m x 3.3m\nHardwood flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, fitted wardrobes and roller blinds. \n\nFamily Bathroom 1.9m x 2.5m \nTiled flooring, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b. with tiled splashback, fitted mirror and shaving light, vanity unit, bathtub with tiled surround, window and extractor fan. \n\nBalcony 8.1m x 1.6m\nNorth/East facing balcony with timber decking and an outdoor light fitting.\n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 78 sq.m.\nBuilt in 2006\nWater pump system \nManagement fee approx. 4,200 per annum\n2 designated parking spots \nLift in building\nAdjustable to market rent \n\nItems Included in sale:\nSold as seen.\n\nServices\nMains water \nGas fired central heating \n\nBER \nB3\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 EY82\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \n\nPhilip Byrne\nT: 01 628 6128\nE: philipb@coonan.com\n&\nEddie Luca \nT: 01 628 6128\nE: eddiel@coonan.com\n\n"
      },
